OL,3,GNEWSAEnd in sight for flood-plagued
OL,4,Aroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to install a new drainage system
OL,7,Fon a road which has been the scene of
OL,8,Fpersistent flooding for more than 15
OL,9,Fyears has started.
OL,11,FThe project on Chemical Lane in
OL,12,FLongbridge Hayes, Staffordshire, began
OL,13,Fon Monday and is scheduled to take
OL,14,Fabout 12 weeks, Staffordshire County
OL,15,FCouncil said.
OL,17,FBusiness owners have long complained
OL,18,Fabout the flooding, with one saying it
OL,19,Fwas making it almost impossible for his
OL,20,Fcompany to operate.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
